"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0"
"px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Especially on slow machines it is a"
"dvisable to set this option to \"low quality\" as this will give better speed."
"</p>"
"</body></html>"
